        <detaileddescription>
<para>Parses up to <computeroutput>maxParams</computeroutput> &apos;;&apos;-separated decimal integers from <computeroutput>data</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Reads up to <computeroutput>maxParams</computeroutput> decimal values separated by &apos;;&apos;. Parsing stops at the first byte that is not a digit or &apos;;&apos;. On return, <computeroutput>pos</computeroutput> points to the first non-consumed byte.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>data</parametername>
