    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements the full Sixel parse loop: raster attributes, palette definitions, repeat commands, carriage-return, newline, and sixel data bytes. Buffer growth is handled internally when no raster attributes are present.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Constructed and used on the READER THREAD only. All methods are single-threaded; no locking is performed. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
